Two problems:

1) You have specified a factor model, not a formative model. See https://stats.stackexchange.com/questions/154588/how-to-use-formative-indicators-in-covariance-based-sem-with-lavaan

2) As far as I know, lavaan does not yet support multilevel SEM. Please correct me if this is outdated information.

