Interesting.

>
> However, I can't find much information on multilevel sem on the lavaan project platform.

The documentation of the current development version (0.6-1.1131) says that the cluster argument is not currently used:

cluster

Not used yet.

and the model syntax description does not explain the specification of the levels. I assume that these features are still in development.

How did you know how to specify levels in the model syntax?

Mikko

