> y  0
> x1 0 0
> x2 0 0  0
> x3 0 0  0  0
> x4 0 0  0  0  0
>
> $psi
>          cmp_vr y x1 x2 x3 x4
> comp_var 0
> y        0      0
> x1       0      0 0
> x2       0      0 0  0
> x3       0      0 0  0  0
> x4       0      0 0  0  0  0
>
> $beta
