> 7   7        y ~~        y    0     1     1    0      0   0         .p7.
> 8   8 comp_var ~~ comp_var    0     1     1    0      0   0         .p8.
> 9   9       x1 ~~       x1    0     1     1    0     NA   1         .p9.
> 10 10       x1 ~~       x2    0     1     1    0     NA   1        .p10.
> 11 11       x1 ~~       x3    0     1     1    0     NA   1        .p11.
> 12 12       x1 ~~       x4    0     1     1    0     NA   1        .p12.
